# 下载器路径（可选）- 默认已指向内嵌下载器，一般无需修改
# VIVID_BILI_SCRIPT=./tools/bilibili/bili23_agent_cli.py
# 显式传入的完整 Cookie 会持久化到 configs/secrets/bilibili_cookie.json；环境变量优先于该文件
# VIVID_BILI_COOKIE=
# BILI_SESSDATA=
# VIVID_DOUYIN_SCRIPT=./tools/douyin/douyin.js
VIVID_PIP_INDEX_URL=https://mirrors.aliyun.com/pypi/simple/
VIVID_FFMPEG_BIN=ffmpeg
VIVID_WHISPER_ROOT=
EARS4_API=http://127.0.0.1:7860
EYES_API=http://127.0.0.1:9531
SILICONFLOW_API_KEY=
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=
VIVID_DATA_DIR=./data
VIVID_DEFAULT_FORMAT=both
VIVID_DEFAULT_MODEL=large
VIVID_LANGUAGE=zh
VIVID_TRANSCRIPTION_PRESET_ID=default
VIVID_ACQUISITION_MODE=auto
VIVID_TRANSCRIPTION_BACKEND=auto
VIVID_TRANSCRIPTION_DEVICE=
VIVID_TRANSCRIPTION_TASK=transcribe
VIVID_TRANSCRIPTION_EXTRACT_AUDIO=true
VIVID_TRANSCRIPTION_OUTPUT_DIR=
VIVID_TRANSCRIBE_TIMEOUT=1800
VIVID_OCR_TIMEOUT=1800
VIVID_LLM_MAX_CHARS=8000
VIVID_WEB_MAX_WORKERS=1
VIVID_SILICONFLOW_MODEL=deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2
VIVID_DASHSCOPE_MODEL=qwen-plus
VIVID_SUMMARY_PROVIDERS_FILE=./configs/summary/providers.json
VIVID_VISION_API_CONFIG_ID=
VIVID_VISION_BACKEND=auto
VIVID_VISION_API_BASE=
VIVID_VISION_API_PATH=
VIVID_VISION_API_KEY=
VIVID_VISION_MODEL=
VIVID_VISION_TIMEOUT=
VIVID_VISION_PROMPT_ID=default
VIVID_VISION_PROMPT=只返回画面中的可读字幕文本。如果没有字幕，返回空字符串。
VIVID_VISION_SYSTEM_PROMPT=
VIVID_VISION_SAMPLE_MS=800
VIVID_VISION_MIN_DURATION_MS=1200
VIVID_VISION_API_CONFIGS_FILE=./configs/vision/api_configs.json
VIVID_VISION_PROMPTS_FILE=./configs/vision/prompts.json
VIVID_TRANSCRIPTION_PRESETS_FILE=./configs/transcription/presets.json
